  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In an invite only session allow users already in the lobby to suggest players to invite to the host. For the user who wants their friend to be invited instead of the invite button it would say “suggest for invite” (this would mainly be for friends who aren’t on the host’s friends list). \nThe host would get a prompt just as they would for invite request except it would instead say “ (Name) has suggested (Name) be invited to the lobby.” Maybe even allow the host to click on the avatar icon of the suggested user to be able to send them a friend request. This would be so much better than having to look up each person to invite them if you don’t have a few people on your friends list.",
